    "text": "## Objective\n- Run the `draconic-loop` skill exactly once: claim the next `todo` ROADMAP item, implement test-first, mark done only when `cargo test --workspace` is green, then stop.\n- Claimed item this Loop: **E19.84.01** (deferred namespace object MOP) — first child split out of E19.84 `import.defer` residual.\n\n## Important Details\n- User constraint: exactly **one** Loop item; do **not** start a second item after done.\n- Skill rules: split large ROADMAP rows into child IDs (e.g. `E19.84.01`), complete only the claimed child; verify with `cargo test --workspace` (fast by default) + probe newly added allowlist paths; `done` only when green.\n- E19.83 commit pattern (from git history): parent row stays `todo` while children claimed one per Loop; parent set `done` when last child lands (e.g. `fe73d7f` \"Closes E19.83\").\n- Target is **js only**; `import.defer` syntax is not native to Node hosts — `crates/draconic-backend-js/src/emit.rs` (~line 540) emits `import(` for `ImportPhase::Defer`; deferred *semantics* live in the linker.\n- Current deferred-namespace helper in `crates/draconic-linker/src/lib.rs` (`deferred_namespace_helper_stmts()` ~1687–1775, `make_deferred_namespace_binding()` ~1776–1795, callsites ~423/506) is a `Proxy` whose trap behavior is pinned by already-allowlisted `evaluation-triggers` tests (symbols/`\"then\"` never trigger eval; exported-string get/has/ownKeys/defineProperty trigger).\n- Probe of 31 non-allowlisted import-defer tests: all 5 `deferred-namespace-object` cluster tests FAIL:\n  - `exotic-object-behavior.js` — \"Deferred namespaces …\" (truncated; full assertions not yet read)\n  - `identity.js` — \"Static and dynamic …\" (identity mismatch; that's **E19.84.02**, not this claim)\n  - `to-string-tag.js` — \"Symbol(Symbol.toSt…\" — likely expects `ns[Symbol.toStringTag] === \"Deferred Module\"` while helper returns `\"Module\"`\n  - `json-module.js` — compile error `expected ';' after expression at 13..14` (that's **E19.84.03**, JSON import attributes not this claim)\n  - `reexport-deferred-ns-evaluation.js` — node exit 1 (that's **E19.84.04**)\n- `harness/propertyHelper.js` `verifyProperty` (`isConfigurable` = delete→TypeError then `!hasOwnProperty`; `isWritable` = set then read-back) means MOP descriptors must be `configurable: false` (current helper returns `true`).\n- `tests/test262/allowlist.txt` has 230 `import-defer` entries; probe binary already built at `./target/release/probe`.\n\n## Work State\n### Completed\n- `ROADMAP.md` edited: E19.84 parent → `todo`; split into 4 children; **E19.84.01 → `in_progress`**:\n  - `E19.84.01` in_progress: Deferred ns object MOP — `exotic-object-behavior` + `to-string-tag` (non-extensible; null proto; sorted ownKeys + `@@toStringTag`; `configurable: false` descriptors; `\"Deferred Module\"` tag; `setPrototypeOf`/`isExtensible`/`preventExtensions` semantics)\n  - `E19.84.02` todo: identity/caching (`identity.js`)\n  - `E19.84.03` todo: JSON-module (`json-module.js`)\n  - `E19.84.04` todo: reexport preserves deferred (`reexport-deferred-ns-evaluation.js`)\n- `cargo build -p draconic-test262 --bin probe --release` succeeded; probed 31 non-allowlisted import-defer candidates and the 5 deferred-namespace-object tests (results above).\n- Read linker helper + `evaluation-triggers` allowlisted tests pinning current trap semantics; read E19.83 claim/close commit history.\n\n### Active\n- E19.84.01 claimed `in_progress` in ROADMAP.md; no code or test changes made yet (Red phase not started).\n- `/tmp/import_defer_candidates.txt` holds the 31 non-allowlisted import-defer paths; `/tmp/dno.txt` the 5 deferred-namespace-object paths.\n\n### Blocked\n- None. (Full assertion bodies of `exotic-object-behavior.js` and `to-string-tag.js` were truncated in output — must be re-read to enumerate exact MOP requirements.)\n\n## Next Move\n1. Read full contents of `third_party/test262/test/language/import/import-defer/deferred-namespace-object/exotic-object-behavior.js` and `to-string-tag.js` to enumerate exact MOP assertions.\n2. Red: extend/add failing tests for the MOP gaps (likely: `configurable: false` + `writable: true` + `enumerable: true` descriptors on evaluated-export keys; `Symbol.toStringTag` = `\"Deferred Module\"` with no evaluation trigger; null proto; `ownKeys` sorted subset without extra `\"then\"`/symbol keys; proxy target non-extensible after `Object.preventExtensions(ns)`).\n3. Implement in `deferred_namespace_helper_stmts()` in `crates/draconic-linker/src/lib.rs` (keep `evaluation-triggers` behaviors green — symbols/`\"then\"` must stay non-triggering, exported-string get/has/ownKeys/defineProperty must still trigger).\n4. Verify: probe `exotic-object-behavior.js` + `to-string-tag.js` via `./target/release/probe`; add the two newly-green paths to `tests/test262/allowlist.txt`; run `cargo test --workspace`; mark E19.84.01 `done` in `ROADMAP.md`; commit (following `E19.83.0X …` message style); stop.\n\n## Relevant Files\n- `ROADMAP.md`: E19.84 parent + children rows; E19.84.01 currently `in_progress` — must end this Loop marked `done`.\n- `crates/draconic-linker/src/lib.rs`: `deferred_namespace_helper_stmts()` (~1687), `make_deferred_namespace_binding()` (~1776), callsites (~423, ~506), unit test `link_import_defer_namespace_lazy` (~3017+) asserts `__draconic_deferred_ns` + `__draconic_eval_m`.\n- `tests/test262/allowlist.txt`: 230 `import-defer` entries; add the newly-green test paths here.\n- `tests/test262/src/bin/probe.rs` + built `./target/release/probe`: one-shot per-path PASS/FAIL probe.\n- `tests/test262/src/lib.rs`: `compile_test_to_js_at`/`run_case` (~1962/1976/1656); host handling for module-flag tests (`needs_static_link`, `file_module_ns_identity`, ~2020–2140).\n- `crates/draconic-backend-js/src/emit.rs` (~540): `ImportPhase::Defer` emitted as `import(` (Node host lacks `import.defer` syntax).\n- `third_party/test262/test/language/import/import-defer/`: `deferred-namespace-object/` (5 fail