    "text": "E19.84.02 complete and committed. Work package summary:\n\n**Red**: `identity.js` failed on the dynamic-import assertion — all deferred sites collapsed to the eager `__ns0` object and `import.defer` emitted plain `import()`.\n\n**Green** (crates/draconic-linker/src/lib.rs):\n- Per-module shared deferred namespace binding `__ns_defer{id}` (built once at link time, distinct from eager `__ns{id}`), with a new `BINDING_DEFERRED_NAMESPACE` sentinel so re-exports through `resolve_local_export_binding`/`final_binding_name` keep deferred identity.\n- All static `import defer * as ns` sites rename onto the shared binding; eager targets read initialized bindings directly (no eval thunk), lazy targets use the once-eval thunk.\n- Dynamic `import.defer(\"specifier\")` of a linked module is rewritten to the shared binding via `rewrite_dynamic_deferred_imports` (specifier resolved against the importer's own path); unlinkable specifiers stay plain dynamic imports.\n\n**Verify**: `identity.js` PASSes; whole `import-defer` family green except the pre-existing `import-defer-does-not-evaluate` (fails on `main` too); `cargo test --workspace` — 58 suites, 0 failures. ROADMAP E19.84.02 → done, committed `7a25f2d`.\n\nLoop rule respected: one item only, stopped after committing.",
