erminate worker; no shared JS heap across isolates | `tests/conformance` fixtures `concurrency/workers` |\n628: | C01.04 | todo | native | OS thread backing for native workers | `crates/draconic-runtime`, `tests/conformance` fixtures `concurrency/workers` |\n629: | C02 | todo | both | Message-passing channels: send/recv; structured-clone or transfer policy; bounded buffer as designed | `tests/conformance` fixtures `concurrency/channels` |\n630: | C02.01 | todo | both | Channel send/recv: scalars + strings | `tests/conformance` fixtures `concurrency/channels` |\n631: | C02.02 | todo | both | Structured-clone (or designed) for plain objects; reject shared refs | `tests/conformance` fixtures `concurrency/channels` |\n632: | C02.03 | todo | both | Bounded buffer: backpressure / full-channel behavior as designed | `tests/conformance` fixtures `concurrency/channels` |\n633: | C02.04 | todo | both | Worker ↔ parent channel e2e (C01 + C02) | `tests/conformance` fixtures `concurrency/channels` |\n634: | C03 | todo | native | `once` / thread-safe init; mutex only if Runtime internals need it | `crates/draconic-runtime`, `tests/conformance` fixtures `concurrency/sync` |\n635: | C03.01 | todo | native | `once` / thread-safe init primitive | `crates/draconic-runtime`, `tests/conformance` fixtures `concurrency/sync` |\n636: | C03.02 | todo | native | Runtime-internal mutex only where required (not user-facing shared heap) | `crates/draconic-runtime` |\n637: | C04 | todo | compiler | Parallel `draconic test`: multi-fixture workers; deterministic aggregate exit | `crates/draconic-cli`, `tests/integration` |\n638: | C04.01 | todo | compiler | `draconic test` runs fixtures on worker pool (N>1) | `crates/draconic-cli`, `tests/integration` |\n639: | C04.02 | todo | compiler | Deterministic aggregate exit code + stable failure summary order | `crates/draconic-cli`, `tests/integration` |\n640: | C05 | todo | both | Structured cancellation / timeout helpers on async work (channels + timer