      },
      "output": "commit 824f408b3df29ebfaaddcb88bd91bac9f93eaed6\nAuthor: Jared Hembrow <jared.hembrow@gmail.com>\nDate:   Thu Aug 6 06:36:10 2026 +1000\n\n    E19.85 ArrayBuffer immutable APIs: .immutable / transferToImmutable / sliceToImmutable polyfill + allowlist\n    \n    Node (v26) does not ship the finished immutable-arraybuffer proposal, so the\n    E19.85 harness polyfills the reachable semantics: accessor + method shape with\n    correct name/length/non-constructability, TOINDEX + ToIntegerOrInfinity with\n    faithful valueOf/toString/@@toPrimitive ordering and BigInt/Symbol TypeError,\n    detach-and-copy transferToImmutable, bounds-checked sliceToImmutable, and the\n    .immutable flag via a WeakSet. Registers the immutable ctor-arg factory so\n    harness_e19_66's \"immutable\" feature filter resolves after install; makes\n    $262.detachArrayBuffer idempotent for already-detached buffers. Adds 24\n    allowlist paths (all probed green) and drops species-returns-immutable-arraybuffer,\n    which only passed incidentally while the methods were absent.\n\n ROADMAP.md                          |   2 +-\n tests/test262/allowlist.txt         |  25 +++-\n tests/test262/src/harness_e19_85.js | 242 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++\n tests/test262/src/lib.rs            |  82 +++++++++++-\n 4 files changed, 348 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)\n===\ncommit 824f408b3df29ebfaaddcb88bd91bac9f93eaed6\nAuthor: Jared Hembrow <jared.hembrow@gmail.com>\nDate:   Thu Aug 6 06:36:10 2026 +1000\n\n    E19.85 ArrayBuffer immutable APIs: .immutable / transferToImmutable / sliceToImmutable polyfill + allowlist\n    \n    Node (v26) does not ship the finished immutable-arraybuffer proposal, so the\n    E19.85 harness polyfills the reachable semantics: accessor + method shape with\n    correct name/length/non-constructability, TOINDEX + ToIntegerOrInfinity with\n    faithful valueOf/toString/@@toPrimitive ordering and BigInt/Symbol TypeError,\n    detach-and-copy transferToImmu