    "type": "text",
    "text": "## Objective\n- Run the draconic-loop skill exactly once: claim the next ROADMAP.md `todo` item, implement it test-first, mark it `done` only when `cargo test --workspace` is green, then stop without starting a second item.\n\n## Important Details\n- Skill steps: Claim → Orient → Red → Green → Verify. Empty-todo guard: if no `todo` row exists anywhere, stop immediately; do not invent work.\n- Exactly one `in_progress` row at a time. Verify = `cargo test` (touched crates) then `cargo test --workspace`; always probe newly added allowlist paths via `cargo build -p draconic-test262 --bin probe --release` + `./target/release/probe` (paths on stdin) before `done`.\n- Test262 is js-target only; suite present at `third_party/test262`; baseline-report shows pass=43512 fail=0 skip=0.\n- Repo: branch `main`, 43 commits ahead of `origin/main`, HEAD=`824f408` (E19.85 ArrayBuffer immutable APIs); untracked `.loop/logs/`; uncommitted local edit to `tests/test262/src/bin/probe.rs` (removed 160-char message truncation, kept as debug aid).\n- Linker naming: eager/shared ns binding `__ns{id}` (`shared_namespace_binding_name`), deferred `__ns_defer{id}` (`deferred_namespace_binding_name`), `deferred_eval_fn_name(mod_id)`.\n- Root cause of import-site failure: eager ns is a plain object literal (built by `namespace_object_props_resolved`, values are direct reads of mangled bindings) appended **after** the target module's body, so an importing module's body reads `__ns0` from TDZ → `ReferenceError: Cannot access '__ns0' before initialization`.\n- `deferred_namespace_helper_stmts` (line 2229) already implements a Proxy-based exotic-object template (null-proto target, non-configurable/writable/enumerable keys, `preventExtensions`, traps incl. lazy `ensure()`) — reusable pattern for the eager ns polyfill.\n- Node v26 verified semantics: proto null / not instanceof Object / not extensible; ownKeys sorted (ASCII → `default` → Unicode λ/μ/π, Symbol.toStringTag last); export desc `{value, writable:true, enumerable:true, configurable:false}`; toStringTag `{value:\"Module\", writable:false, enumerable:false, configurable:false}`; delete non-exported → true, exported → TypeError (Reflect false), toStringTag → TypeError (Reflect false); set/Reflect.set → false/TypeError; setPrototypeOf(ns,{}) → TypeError, (ns,null) → true; Object.freeze → TypeError, isFrozen false; Object.keys with uninit binding → ReferenceError, Object.getOwnPropertyNames → no throw.\n- Node's native `super.foo = 14` on a namespace receiver throws **TypeError**, but `super-access-to-tdz-binding.js` asserts **ReferenceError** — the harness polyfill must implement spec behavior (GetOwnProperty→Get→TDZ) rather than rely on Node's native exotic namespace.\n\n## Work State\n### Completed\n- Orient phase done for the module-namespace exotic internals cluster: workspace crate list, test262 harness layout (`tests/test262/src/lib.rs`, `harness_e19_*.js` incl. `harness_e19_85.js`, `force_esm_hooks.mjs`), and linker ns-generation code paths mapped.\n- Probed all non-FIXTURE `test/language/module-code/namespace/internals/*.js`; the 8 currently allowlisted paths all pass: enumerate-binding-uninit, get-nested-namespace-dflt-skip, get-nested-namespace-props-nrml, get-own-property-str-found-uninit, get-str-found-uninit, object-hasOwnProperty-binding-uninit, object-keys-binding-uninit, object-propertyIsEnumerable-binding-uninit.\n- Confirmed visible probe failures: define-own-property, delete-exported-init, delete-exported-uninit, delete-non-exported, get-own-property-str-found-init, get-own-property-str-not-found, get-own-property-sym (probe output truncated; more failures expected in the tail).\n- Read the target fixtures in `third_party/test262/test/language/module-code/namespace/internals/` (39 files): own-property-keys-sort (16 string keys in exact order + Symbol.toStringTag last), define-own-property (defineProperty false/TypeError, freeze TypeError, isFrozen false, desc.writable true), delete-*, set, get-*, has-*, is-extensible, get-prototype-of, set-prototype-of(-null), super-access-to-tdz-binding (expects ReferenceError), super-set-to-tdz-binding-with-accessor, nested-namespace fixtures.\n- Ran Node v26 baseline experiments in `/tmp` (`ns_test1..6.mjs`, `exact.mjs`, `exact2.mjs`, `prox.mjs`, `k.mjs`) confirming the semantics listed above.\n\n### Active\n- No ROADMAP.md row claimed/`in_progress` yet; the first full read of ROADMAP.md was truncated (only lines 1–22 and 311–317 visible), so the exact next-`todo` ID/description must be re-read before claiming.\n- The next item is presumed to be the module-namespace exotic-object internals row following E19.85 (tests = `tests/test262` `test/language/module-code/namespace/internals/*`).\n\n### Blocked\n- (none)\n\n## Next Move\n1. Re-read ROADMAP.md in full; find the first `todo` row with satisfied blockers (presumed: module-namespace exotic-object MOP internals after E19.85) and set it to `in_progress`.\n2. Red: add/extend failing tests (allowlist entries for `test/language/module-code/namespace/internals/*` asserting spec semantics — TDZ ReferenceError, sorted ownKeys, exotic traps); Green: rework eager namespace emission in `crates/draconic-linker` (Proxy-style exotic object created before any importer body runs, lazy reads of mangled export bindings so uninit throws ReferenceError and updates stay live); then probe + `cargo test --workspace`; stop after one item.\n\n## Relevant Files\n- `ROADMAP.md` — source of truth; claim the next `todo` row here.\n- `crates/draconic-linker/src/lib.rs` (3895 lines) — module flattening and ns generation: `namespace_object_props_resolved` (2593), `deferred_namespace_helper_stmts` (2229), `make_deferred_namespace_binding` (2351), `shared_namespace_binding_name`/`deferred_namespace_binding_name` (1369/1373), `deferred_eval_fn_name` (2041), `collect_resolved_exports` (686), `final_binding_name` (1377); ns stmt appended after module body around lines 396–596.\n- `tests/test262/src/bin/probe.rs` — stdin path probe; locally modified (full error messages).\n- `tests/test262/src/lib.rs` — harness runner (`run_case`, `resolve_suite_root`, `Status`), harness include wiring, `force_esm_hooks.mjs`.\n- `tests/test262/allowlist.txt` — 45,468 lines; only 8 `namespace/internals` paths currently allowlisted (lines 34328–34335).\n- `third_party/test262/test/language/module-code/namespace/internals/` — 39 test fixtures defining the expected exotic-object semantics.\n- `tests/test262/baseline-report.md` — baseline pass=43512 fail=0.\n- `crates/draconic-parser/src/lib.rs` — `parse_export_default` (2703): default exports bound as `__default`.",
