    "text": "Done. One atomic Loop completed — **T07.01** implemented test-first and committed (`262b37f`), with `cargo test --workspace` fully green. Stopping here per the loop rules.\n\n**What was delivered:**\n- **Red → Green**: 6 reject fixtures under `tests/conformance/fixtures/types/reject/` (too-few, too-many, arg-type mismatch, native param, shape missing/wrong prop) + positive `annotated_call_ok` fixture + 13 unit tests in `tests/conformance/tests/types.rs`.\n- **Implementation** (`crates/draconic-check/src/lib.rs`): new `FnSig` struct + `fn_sigs` table parallel to `symbol_types`; signatures recorded for non-generic annotated function declarations and simple-ident bindings of function/arrow values; `check_call_sig` enforces arity (required annotated params, rest, no-rest max) and per-arg assignability via `require_assignable_expr` at call sites.\n- **Permissiveness preserved**: only functions with ≥1 annotated param get a signature, so untyped E19-era JS calls stay fully permissive; generic calls continue through the existing `instantiate_generic_call` path.\n- Cleaned up the temporary `crates/t07probe` probe crate; removed its workspace member entry.\n\n**ROADMAP state**: T07 `in_progress` (cluster), T07.01 `done`; T07.02–T07.05 remain `todo` for future loops.",
