ance` fixtures `es/legacy` |\n401: | N08.16 | todo | native | Real native observations: annex-b / late ES (E18 children) | `tests/conformance` fixtures `es/annex-b` |\n402: | N08.17 | todo | native | Real native observations: dual-worlds boundary (T06) | `tests/conformance` fixtures `types/dual` |\n403: | N09 | todo | native | GC durability / stress (depth after N08; see `docs/planning/native-depth-gaps.md`) | `crates/draconic-runtime` |\n404: | N09.01 | todo | native | GC stress: allocate/retain/drop many JS values without leak/crash; assert live_count after collect | `crates/draconic-runtime` tests |\n405: | N09.02 | todo | native | GC mark correctness: rooted object property values stay live across collect (trace object props) | `crates/draconic-runtime` tests |\n406: \n407: ---\n408: \n409: ## Tooling\n410: \n411: | ID | Status | Targets | Item | Tests |\n412: |----|--------|---------|------|-------|\n413: | U01 | done | compiler | `draconic test` runner integration | `crates/draconic-cli` |\n414: | U02 | done | compiler | Diagnostics: span, message, pretty print | `crates/draconic-diagnostics` |\n415: | U03 | done | compiler | Source maps for JS emit | `crates/draconic-backend-js` |\n416: | U04 | todo | compiler | `draconic check`: typecheck + bind, no emit; exit non-zero on errors | `crates/draconic-cli` |\n417: | U05 | todo | compiler | Formatter: `draconic fmt` idempotent on fixtures; stable style | `crates/draconic-cli`, `tests/integration` |\n418: | U06 | todo | compiler | LSP basics: diagnostics, hover types, go-to-definition | `crates/draconic-lsp` (or cli), `tests/integration` |\n419: | U07 | todo | native | Native debug info: DWARF (or LLVM equivalent) mapping Draconic source lines | `crates/draconic-backend-llvm`, `tests/integration` |\n420: | U08 | todo | compiler | REPL: read-eval-print (js and/or embed); multi-line; last-value print | `crates/draconic-cli`, `tests/integration` |\n421: | U09 | todo | compiler | Error codes + suggestions: stable code