    "type": "text",
    "text": "## Objective\n- Execute the `draconic-loop` skill exactly once: claim the next `todo` item in `ROADMAP.md` whose blockers are satisfied, implement it test-first (red → green), mark it `done` only when `cargo test --workspace` is green, then stop without starting a second item.\n\n## Important Details\n- Repo root: `/Users/jaredhembrow/Projects/draconic/draconic`.\n- Skill rules: read `CONTEXT.md` + relevant ADRs + `ROADMAP.md` first; prefer historical **B/E/T/N/U** spine before Phase 2 **P/S**; do not start **E*** clusters until **B10** is `done`; exactly one `in_progress`; no `todo` rows → stop and report empty board (no invented work).\n- `ROADMAP.md` legend (line 14): `Targets: native`/`both` means fixtures assert **program results** on native (`native.stdout` / equivalent), **not** the B08 LLVM hello-stub fallback (`hello\\n` only).\n- Baseline verified: `cargo test --workspace` passes green (exit 0, no FAILED lines) before any changes.\n- Latest commit: `b881e0b T07.05 Object literal excess-property check vs annotated shape` — the **T07** cluster (T07.01–T07.05) is finished; working tree clean except untracked `.loop/logs/`.\n- Toolchain available: `clang` (Apple clang 21.0.0), `node` v26 (`/opt/homebrew/bin/node`).\n- LLVM backend adapter dispatch (`crates/draconic-backend-llvm/src/lib.rs::emit_llvm_ir`): native ints/layouts (N01–N03) → `native_ints.rs`; Promise/async (N06) → `es_promise.rs`; eval/Function (N07) → `es_eval.rs` (fold-at-emit via Embed); empty program → B08 hello; otherwise `Err(unsupported_native_diagnostic())`.\n- `es_eval.rs` is the model for native observations: classify module subset via Embed (`is_eval_fold_module`), `fold_eval_program` returns `Vec<Observation>`, emit Runtime ABI print calls (`PRINT_I64`, `PRINT_STR`, `PRINT_BOOL`) for top-level user `let` values in declaration order.\n- Conformance harness: `tests/conformance/src/lib.rs` exposes `Fixture`, `TargetExpect { exit, check, stdout, error_contains }`, `load_fixtures`, `run_fixture` (results carry `.ok`, `.fixture_id`, `.target.as_str()`, `.message`). Test files in `tests/conformance/tests/*.rs` use the `fixture_present` + `runs` pattern.\n- `.meta` format examples: `tests/conformance/fixtures/es/async/promise_basics.meta` (`targets: js,native`, `native.exit: 0`, `native.stdout: function\\n42\\n7\\n2\\n`) and `tests/conformance/fixtures/native/floats/arith_f64.meta` (`native.stdout: 10.5\\n2\\n12.5\\n8.5\\n21\\n5.25\\n`).\n- Runtime print semantics (`crates/draconic-runtime/src/draconic_rt.c`): `print_i64` → `%lld\\n`, `print_u64` → `%llu\\n`, `print_f64` → `%.17g\\n`, `print_bool` → `true`/`false`, `print_str` → `puts` (nil-safe).\n- Embed value domain: `EmbedValue { Undefined, Null, Boolean, Number(f64), String(String) }` with `typeof_name()` mapping (`Null → \"object\"`, etc.); `Observation { Number(f64), String(String), Bool(bool), Function }` in `crates/draconic-embed/src/fold.rs`.\n- IR shapes (`crates/draconic-ir/src/lib.rs`): `Module { locals, body, body_spans, shapes }`, `Local { id, name, ty, kind }`; `Stmt::Declare { local, init, kind }` is the relevant top-level form for the expression fixtures; `BinaryOp`/`UnaryOp`/`AssignOp` come from `draconic_ast`.\n- Workspace members: `crates/draconic-{diagnostics,ast,lexer,parser,linker,check,ir,frontend,backend-js,backend-llvm,runtime,embed,cli}` + `tests/{integration,conformance,test262}`.\n\n## Work State\n### Completed\n- Read `CONTEXT.md` and `ROADMAP.md` (with table sections: B/E19.82 cluster, R critical path, P product, S spec rows).\n- Confirmed **T07** cluster fully `done` via git log (T07.01–T07.05) and green workspace baseline.\n- Surveyed conformance fixtures: 208 `targets: js`, 13 `targets: js,native` (all `es/async/*` + `smoke/empty`), 17 `targets: native` (`native/*`). All 12 `tests/conformance/fixtures/es/expressions/*` fixtures are currently `targets: js` only.\n- Catalogued the 12 E01 expression fixtures and their expected values from `.meta` `js.check` lines (arithmetic, comparison, bitwise, exponentiation, conditional, assignment, comma, unary_keywords, update, compound_assignment, nullish_logical_assign, logical).\n- Confirmed no `in_progress` item exists and no ROADMAP rows were modified (read-only orientation so far).\n- `cargo test --workspace` baseline verified green.\n\n### Active\n- Orientation phase only; no item claimed yet — the next spine `todo` is the first N-section row after N07 (N07.02–N07.04 eval being the last committed N work), which is inferred to be **N08 \"Native JS-value observations (expressions)\"**: promote E01 expression fixtures to `targets: js,native` with real `native.stdout` program results, via a new fold/interpret-at-emit path (mirroring `es_eval.rs` + Runtime ABI prints). **Exact N08 row wording/Tests column was not visible in the truncated ROADMAP reads — verify before claiming.**\n\n### Blocked\n- None.\n\n## Next Move\n1. Re-read `ROADMAP.md` N section to confirm the exact first satisfiable `todo` row (expected `N08`, noting its ID, item text, and `Tests` paths), then set it to `in_progress`.\n2. Write red tests: extend/duplicate `tests/conformance/fixtures/es/expressions/*.{drac,meta}` so the claimed fixtures include `targets: js,native` + `native.exit: 0` + `native.stdout:` (computed program results, e.g. arithmetic → `3\\n6\\n12\\n4\\n1\\n7\\n9\\n-5\\n7\\n2\\n`), wired through `tests/conformance/tests/expressions.rs` (or the item's specified Tests paths) so native runs fail on the current \"unsupported native diagnostic\".\n3. Implement green: add a classifier + fold/emit adapter in `crates/draconic-backend-llvm` (reusing `draconic_embed` interpreters or a new expression-algebra fold) that emits Runtime ABI print calls for top-level user `let` values in declaration order; hook it into `emit_llvm_ir` dispatch before the unsupported diagnostic.\n4. Verify: `cargo test -p draconic-conformance` for touched crates, then `cargo test --workspace`; probe newly added allowlist/fixture paths if any Test262 entries are touched.\n5. Mark the item `done` in `ROADMAP.md` only when the workspace is green, then stop (no second item).\n\n## Relevant Files\n- `ROADMAP.md`: source of truth; the next `todo` to claim (N section — verify N08 row text/Tests paths).\n- `CONTEXT.md`: product/toolchain terminology read before work.\n- `tests/conformance/fixtures/es/expressions/*.{drac,meta}`: 12 E01 fixtures, currently `targets: js`; candidates for `js,native` + `native.stdout`.\n- `tests/conformance/tests/expressions.rs`: E01 fixture tests (`fixture_present` + `runs` per fixture).\n- `tests/conformance/src/lib.rs`: harness (`Fixture`, `TargetExpect`, `load_fixtures`, `run_fixture`, `fixtures_dir`).\n- `crates/draconic-backend-llvm/src/lib.rs`: adapter dispatch in `emit_llvm_ir`; where the new N08 adapter hooks in.\n- `crates/draconic-backend-llvm/src/es_eval.rs`: fold-at-emit native-observation model (classify → fold → print).\n- `crates/draconic-embed/src/lib.rs` and `src/fold.rs`: `EmbedValue`, `Observation`, `fold_eval_program`, IR interpreter building blocks.\n- `crates/draconic-runtime/src/abi.rs`: `AbiFn`, `llvm_declares`, `PRINT_I64`, `PRINT_STR`, `PRINT_BOOL`, `GC_INIT`, `ES_EVAL_DECLARES`.\n- `crates/draconic-runtime/src/draconic_rt.c`: native print implementations (decimal, `%.17g`, `true`/`false`).\n- `crates/draconic-ir/src/lib.rs`: `Module`, `Local`, `Stmt`, `Expr`, `AssignTarget`, `Param`, `Pattern` IR shapes.\n- `tests/conformance/fixtures/es/async/promise_basics.{drac,meta}`: reference for a `targets: js,native` fixture with `native.stdout`.\n- `tests/conformance/fixtures/native/floats/arith_f64.meta`: reference native-only fixture with `native.stdout`.",
